    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, chills, or sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Dysuria, frequency, and urgency; no hematuria, vaginal discharge, or flank pain</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild suprapubic discomfort; no nausea, vomiting, or diarrhea</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Usual mild low back ache, no new back or flank pain</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No new numbness, weakness, or bladder or bowel control problem</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
